elder.25=A town grows through its people. Take these two Verdant Catalysts and use them to train a resident's profession skills from their profile.
logger.75=Stubborn roots should not stand in the way of your next project. Here are five Root Removers to clear a little room.
miner.75=You have seen how useful a Glow Ring can be underground. These plans let an Apprentice with Jewelry 5 make more at a jewelry workplace. Look under Browse all plans.
guild_master.25=Good orders keep a patrol together. Take this Command Flag to direct your guards to a spot on the ground.
guild_master.75=A long journey is hard on your equipment. Take these six repair kits for your own gear before your next expedition.
pyrotechnic.25=Every growing town deserves a celebration! Take eight fireworks and set them off from the ground when the moment feels right.
pyrotechnic.75=Let us give your town something bright to look forward to. These firework plans need an Apprentice with Crafting 4 at a crafting workplace. Each batch makes four.
bard.25=A long road deserves a second wind. Take these three Stamina Potions for your next adventure.
bard.50=Every town needs a place to gather. These Festival Flag plans need Crafting 3 at a crafting workplace. Raise a few when we next play together.
bard.75=You have earned a place in the troupe! Use this Jester Hat Pattern to add it to your town wardrobe.
builder.25=A good town starts with a clear path. Take this Path Designer Shovel and put those streets where you want them.
builder.50=These white wall finishes will brighten your next build. Use this palette to add them to your town.
builder.75=You have helped this town grow into something special. This Thorium Building Staff should make your next project easier.
clown.25=Apparently friendship comes with a red nose. Use this pattern for the town wardrobe. At least someone else can wear it for a change.
clown.50=Balloons. Because people insist the town look cheerful. These plans need Crafting 3 at a crafting workplace. Try not to let them all float away.
clown.75=A red balloon hat. Ridiculous, is it not? Use the pattern for your residents. I made it for you, so pretend to like it.
crystal_keeper.25=A little light for your workshop. These eight cyan crystals will help with jewelry and other careful work.
crystal_keeper.50=Strength takes many forms. Use these two Gaia Shards in a resident profile to improve their attributes.
crystal_keeper.75=Let us give that little Glow Ring a brighter heart. These Large Glow Ring plans require Jewelry 7, a Glow Ring and fine crystals at a jewelry workplace.
florist.25=Flowers belong in more places than a vase. Use this Pink Flower Crown Pattern to add a little spring to the town wardrobe.
florist.50=A garden entrance should feel welcoming. These Plant Arch plans need an Apprentice with Crafting 4 and a crafting workplace.
florist.75=Even the strangest little garden deserves care. These Spooky Terrarium plans need Crafting 6. Find them under Browse all plans at a crafting workplace.
furniture_merchant.25=Changing your mind is part of decorating, matey. Take this Packaging Wand to pack up placed props and give them a new home.
furniture_merchant.50=A little harbor light does wonders for an evening stroll. These Palm Streetlight plans need Crafting 4 at a crafting workplace.
furniture_merchant.75=Your guards deserve a fine looking hall. These decorative Weapon Rack plans need Crafting 6. They make a prop, not usable weapons or equipment storage.
